{
  "name": "HL · Customers from orders",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Customers from orders (Lesson 3.5)\nReads every order (messy names and phone formats), sends rows with no phone to a Fix list, then one Code node (Run Once for All Items) normalises phones to +234, groups by phone, sums lifetime value, finds first and last order dates, ranks customers, and updates the Customers sheet by phone.\n\n**Credential:** Google Sheets (OAuth2) in Orders, Fix list and Customers.\n**Placeholder:** YOUR_SHEET_ID (tabs Orders, Fix list, Customers).\n\nOrders has the lesson's **12 sample rows pinned** (fake phones). Expect 6 customers, Chef Tunde first with 164,000 over 3 orders, and 1 Walk-in row on the Fix list. Unpin Orders to use your real sheet.\n\nLater: swap Manual Trigger for a nightly Schedule Trigger.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 420
      },
